* The Bluesky reader uses the public AT Protocol API of Bluesky and, as an
  alternative, its public RSS feeds and oEmbed endpoint.
* The GitHub client uses the official GitHub REST API.
* The podcast reader parses standard RSS feeds published by podcast hosts.

The module does not include code that scrapes third-party websites.

